      117.62,
      109.13,
      259.28,
      134.2
    ],
    "text": "An Act to amend the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman-SC700"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      149.93,
      309.71,
      175.0
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      190.47,
      309.69,
      215.8
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Universities (Amendment) Act, No. of 2025.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      231.27,
      309.71,
      270.2
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 49 of the Universities Act, No.16 of 1978 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby amended as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      91.2,
      287.33,
      242.52,
      298.8
    ],
    "text": "(1) in subsection (1) of that section \u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      116.2,
      314.53,
      309.71,
      339.6
    ],
    "text": "(a) by the re-lettering of that subsection as paragraph (a) of that subsection;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      116.2,
      355.33,
      309.7,
      394.0
    ],
    "text": "(b) by the substitution for all the words from \u201cThe Dean shall be elected\u201d to the end of the re-lettered paragraph (a), of the following: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      149.2,
      409.73,
      309.71,
      475.6
    ],
    "text": "\u201cThe Dean shall be elected by the Faculty Board from among the Senior Professors, Professors, Associate Professors and Senior Lecturers (Grade I), of the Faculty.\u201d; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      91.2,
      492.73,
      309.72,
      534.2
    ],
    "text": "(2) by the insertion immediately after the re-lettered paragraph (a) of subsection (1), of the following paragraph: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      51.44,
      231.1,
      56.44,
      244.24
    ],
    "text": "5",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      48.94,
      327.1,
      58.94,
      340.24
    ],
    "text": "10",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
