    ],
    "text": "20",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      78.16,
      45.82,
      249.52,
      59.31
    ],
    "text": "Universities (Amendment)2",
    "fonts": [
      "MinionPro-Regular",
      "Times-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      159.52,
      82.0,
      320.05,
      215.87
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(b) Where any Professor or Lecturer referred to in paragraph (a) is elected as the Dean of the Faculty under that paragraph, and is, at the time of election, holding the post of the Head of the Department of Study of that Faculty, such Professor or Lecturer shall cease to hold the post of the Head of the Department of Study upon being elected as the Dean of the Faculty.\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      101.52,
      233.0,
      320.03,
      289.47
    ],
    "text": "(3) in subsection (2) of that section, by the substitution for the words \u201cunless removed from office,\u201d, of the words \u201cunless removed from office by the Council,\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      101.52,
      306.6,
      320.05,
      378.07
    ],
    "text": "(4) in subsection (3) of that section, by the substitution for the words \u201canother Head of a Department of that Faculty\u201d, of the words \u201canother Senior Professor, Professor, Associate Professor or Senior Lecturer (Grade I), of that Faculty\u201d; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      101.52,
      395.2,
      320.03,
      421.67
    ],
    "text": "(5) by the addition immediately after subsection (3) of that section, of the following new subsection: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      131.52,
      437.4,
      320.04,
      462.47
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(4) No person shall be appointed as the Dean of a Faculty for more than two terms.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      77.52,
      477.94,
      320.03,
      503.27
    ],
    "text": "3. Section 51 of the principal enactment is hereby amended as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      101.52,
      520.4,
      320.03,
      546.87
    ],
    "text": "(1) by the repeal of subsection (1) of that section and the substitution therefor, of the following subsection: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      324.43,
      480.33,
      374.64,
      518.31
    ],
    "text": "Amendment of section 51 of the principal enactment",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
