  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      135.45,
      45.62,
      307.8,
      57.87
    ],
    "text": "3Universities (Amendment)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      122.0,
      81.4,
      310.61,
      133.67
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(1) (a) The Head of a Department of Study shall be a Senior Professor appointed by the Council upon the recommendation of the Vice-Chancellor.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      122.0,
      149.4,
      310.61,
      242.47
    ],
    "text": "(b) In the absence of a Senior Professor, a Professor, an Associate Professor, a Senior Lecturer (Grade I) or a Senior Lecturer (Grade II) shall be appointed by the Council in that order, as the Head of the Department of Study, on the recommendation of the Vice-Chancellor.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      122.0,
      258.2,
      310.61,
      310.47
    ],
    "text": "(c) Prior to make any such appointment referred to in paragraph (a) or (b), the consent of the selected individual with respect to such appointment, shall be obtained.\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      92.0,
      327.6,
      310.61,
      354.07
    ],
    "text": "(2) by the insertion immediately after subsection (1), of the following new subsection: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      122.0,
      369.8,
      310.63,
      462.87
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(1A) (a) For the purpose of subsection (1), any Senior Professor, Professor, Associate Professor, or any Senior Lecturer (Grade I) or any Senior Lecturer (Grade II), who has been confirmed in the relevant post, shall be eligible to be appointed as the Head of a Department of Study.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      122.0,
      478.6,
      310.63,
      544.47
    ],
    "text": "(b) In the absence of a Senior Professor, Professor, Associate Professor, Senior Lecturer (Grade I) or a Senior Lecturer (Grade II) for the purpose of subsection (1), who is eligible to be appointed as the Head of a Department of",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      51.44,
      148.1,
      56.44,
      161.24
    ],
    "text": "5",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
